Leaves out the two policy fragments of the Citadel gateway-upgrade module that send usage records to an Event Hub.

The fragments ai-usage and pii-state-saving log to an Event Hub through two loggers (usage-eventhub-logger and
pii-usage-eventhub-logger) that the kit's own deployment makes together with the Event Hub, and the API Management service
refuses to save a fragment whose logger does not exist. The module does not make the loggers, and the service refuses a
logger whose address does not resolve. The Event Hub belongs to the usage recording (an Event Hub, a Logic App and a Cosmos
DB), which this environment leaves out on purpose, and no API that the module makes here includes either fragment.

The patch adds one parameter to bicep/infra/modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep, deployUsageRecordingFragments, which is
false: the two fragments are created only when it is true. It applies to the kit at the commit that the workflows check out
(Azure-Samples/ai-hub-gateway-solution-accelerator, citadel-v1); the checks apply it for real. When the usage recording is
added, this patch goes, and the Event Hub, the two loggers and the two fragments come with it.

diff --git a/bicep/infra/modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep b/bicep/infra/modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep
--- a/bicep/infra/modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep
+++ b/bicep/infra/modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep
@@ -22,6 +22,11 @@ param enableAIModelInference bool = true
 @description('Enable Unified AI API features')
 param enableUnifiedAiApi bool = true
 
+// Meternaut: the two fragments that send usage records to an Event Hub (ai-usage and pii-state-saving) are not created
+// unless this is true. The Event Hub and the loggers that name it belong to the usage recording, which is not deployed.
+@description('Create the fragments that send usage records to an Event Hub')
+param deployUsageRecordingFragments bool = false
+
 // ------------------
 //    RESOURCES
 // ------------------
@@ -30,7 +35,7 @@ resource apimService 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service@2022-08-01' existing = {
   name: apimServiceName
 }
 
-resource aiUsagePolicyFragment 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service/policyFragments@2022-08-01' = {
+resource aiUsagePolicyFragment 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service/policyFragments@2022-08-01' = if (deployUsageRecordingFragments) {
   parent: apimService
   name: 'ai-usage'
   properties: {
@@ -117,7 +122,7 @@ resource piiDenonymizationPolicyFragment 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service/policy
   }
 }
 
-resource piiStateSavingPolicyFragment 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service/policyFragments@2022-08-01' = if (enablePIIAnonymization) {
+resource piiStateSavingPolicyFragment 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service/policyFragments@2022-08-01' = if (enablePIIAnonymization && deployUsageRecordingFragments) {
   parent: apimService
   name: 'pii-state-saving'
   properties: {
@@ -220,7 +225,7 @@ resource resolveModelAliasFragment 'Microsoft.ApiManagement/service/policyFragme
 // ------------------
 
 @description('The name of the AI usage policy fragment')
-output aiUsagePolicyFragmentName string = aiUsagePolicyFragment.name
+output aiUsagePolicyFragmentName string = deployUsageRecordingFragments ? aiUsagePolicyFragment.name : ''
 
 @description('The name of the PII anonymization policy fragment')
 output piiAnonymizationPolicyFragmentName string = piiAnonymizationPolicyFragment.name
@@ -228,7 +233,7 @@ output piiAnonymizationPolicyFragmentName string = piiAnonymizationPolicyFragmen
 @description('The name of the PII deanonymization policy fragment')
 output piiDenonymizationPolicyFragmentName string = piiDenonymizationPolicyFragment.name
 @description('The name of the PII state saving policy fragment')
-output piiStateSavingPolicyFragmentName string = enablePIIAnonymization ? piiStateSavingPolicyFragment.name : ''
+output piiStateSavingPolicyFragmentName string = enablePIIAnonymization && deployUsageRecordingFragments ? piiStateSavingPolicyFragment.name : ''
 @description('The name of the AI Foundry compatibility policy fragment')
 output aiFoundryCompatibilityPolicyFragmentName string = enablePIIAnonymization ? aiFoundryCompatibilityPolicyFragment.name : ''
 
